        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "He had a son whose name was Saul, an impressive young man; and there was not among the children of Israel a more handsome person than he. From his shoulders and upward he was taller than any of the people.",
      "ko": "기스가 아들이 있으니 그 이름은 사울이요 준수한 소년이라 이스라엘 자손 중에 그보다 더 준수한 자가 없고 키는 모든 백성보다 어깨 위는 더 하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a60dfd1d6abe73ea6b011873a857597b394161d7053c8c9f44fb39fe87672fdd",
      "translation_text_hash": "2c07b4c634d7e3c9a03971ba6b1934b568eb533af149e01df485c28d5cbab30e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
