        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "As they went up the ascent to the city, they found young maidens going out to draw water, and said to them, “Is the seer here?”",
      "ko": "그들이 성을 향한 비탈길로 올라가다가 물 길러 나오는 소녀들을 만나 그들에게 묻되 선견자가 여기 있느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "a89fa71f9a5b9dc07e8a860c422675da5403d9ed7ef27a84fe0bf5f6dcae6d75",
      "translation_text_hash": "6c74cd9cd5e6160a3b7bf075c8c6bc473516ab0c7b9c730e20d29cd6acad64e2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
